Smart & Safe Travel Companion App
Project Overview

Developed a Smart & Safe Travel Companion application designed to help solo and budget-conscious travelers identify safer travel destinations, hotels, restaurants and nearby facilities using Machine Learning and Natural Language Processing (NLP).
Objectives
- Improve travel safety for solo travelers.
- Analyze hotel and restaurant reviews to identify safety-related concerns.
- Provide safety scores based on review sentiment.
- Help travelers identify nearby facilities.
- Support emergency assistance and night-time safety.
Key Features
1. Sentiment Analysis: Analyzes travel reviews to identify positive and negative safety-related feedback.
2. Safety Analysis: Uses NLP and Machine Learning to assess safety concerns.
3. Nearby Places: Helps users explore nearby hotels and restaurants.
4. Budget Planning: Helps travelers manage their travel expenses.
5. Night-Time Safety Mode: Provides additional safety support after 8 PM.
6. Emergency SOS: Provides an emergency assistance feature.
Technologies Used
- Python
- Django and Django REST Framework
- React
- Machine Learning
- NLP
- BERT
- SVM
- SQLite
- Leaflet Maps
Project Workflow
1. Collect travel-related reviews.
2. Clean and preprocess review data.
3. Apply NLP techniques for sentiment analysis.
4. Use BERT and SVM for review classification.
5. Generate safety scores.
6. Display nearby travel facilities and safety information.
Project Outcome
Designed an AI-powered travel companion concept that combines sentiment analysis, safety assessment and budget-friendly travel assistance to support safer journeys.
